{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "entry",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Entry points\n**Install from archive…**, Downloads **Install**, **Download & install**, **Get from Nexus** → queue, GitHub, Frameworks **Install**, Modpacks **Install all**, ReShade card, OptiScaler page, RadioEXT **Create/Save station** (+ PNG icon archive)\n\nNexus mod name: file title for add-on/optional files (`downloads::file_line`)\n\n[[Entry points]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "checks",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Download checks\nNexus: MD5 vs `md5_search`\nGitHub: SHA-256 vs published digest\nMismatch → file deleted\n\n[[Entry points#Before an archive reaches the installer]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 220
		},
		{
			"id": "extract",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### prepare: hash + extract\nformat by magic bytes · no `..`, absolute, `:` or symlinks · 100 000 entries / 32 GiB\n→ `staging/incoming-*/files`\n\n[[Archive extraction]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 600,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "q_fomod",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**fomod/ModuleConfig.xml in the archive?**",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "fomod",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### FOMOD wizard\nparse → defaults → UI wizard (`NeedsChoices`, waits in `AppState.pending`) → `resolve`: required + chosen + conditional files by priority\n\n[[FOMOD]]",
			"x": -560,
			"y": 860,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "q_var",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Loose files named like versions of one thing?**",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1080,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "variants",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Versions step\napp-made one-step installer, all ticked; unticked files skipped *(not chosen)*\n\n[[FOMOD#Versions step]]",
			"x": -560,
			"y": 1160,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "plan",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Layout detection: `install::plan`\nFirst match decides the whole archive:\n1. known root folder → **game-root**\n2. `info.json` + `archives/`… → **redmod**\n3. `init.lua` → **cet-mod**\n3b. `metadata.json` + songs / in `radios/` → **radioext-station**\n4. `reshade-shaders/` → **reshade**\n(any `.exe` → refused)\n5. `.archive .xl .reds .yaml` → **loose**\n6. `.ini` only → **engine-config**\nAnything the rule doesn't place → *Skipped*\n\n[[Layout detection]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1260,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 440,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "refused",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Refused\nstandalone program · script · only documents · unrecognised layout\n\n[[Layout detection#Refusal messages]]",
			"x": 560,
			"y": 1300,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "gaps",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Known gaps\nmultiple wrappers, mixed layouts, `tools/` helper, same-name loose files, bare RED4ext/ASI plugins, RAR on Windows, uninstall leftovers\n\n[[Known gaps]]",
			"x": 560,
			"y": 1560,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "prev",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Older version installed?\nsame repo, or shared files + same Nexus page / base name / mostly same files → disable old one first\n\n[[Versions and replacing]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1800,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 220
		},
		{
			"id": "q_conf",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Files owned by another enabled mod?**",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 2100,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "conflict",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Error::Conflict\nlisted per file; tick **Allow overwriting other mods** and retry (prepared files kept)",
			"x": 560,
			"y": 2060,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "deploy",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Deploy and record\n`staging/MOD_ID` · `resolve_ci` · inside game dir, no symlink · back up unowned originals to `backups/` · atomic copy · `mod_files` row with SHA-256\n\n[[Deploy and tracking]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 2260,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 260,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "rollback",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Rollback\nuninstall the half-installed mod; re-enable the old version when replacing",
			"x": 560,
			"y": 2300,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "after",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### After install\n`analysis::index_mod` → Compatibility, Graph, dependencies, MCP · File map · Linux setup checks\n\n[[After install]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 2600,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "report",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Toast\n`Installed X: N files (layout)` · replaced · overrode · backed up · first 5 *Skipped*",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 2900,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "later",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Later\n**Disable** / **Enable** / **Uninstall** / **Verify**: undeploy restores the next owner's copy or the backup; changed files are left in place\n**Adopt**: untracked game-folder mods get a stored copy and mod_files rows without a deploy\n\n[[Disable, enable, uninstall, verify]]",
			"x": -560,
			"y": 2600,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 260,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "home",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# CPMX2077 install flow\nEach box links to its note. Start at [[Home]].\nStructure of the whole app: [[App structure]].\nOne-chart version: [[Install pipeline]].",
			"x": -560,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "2"
		}
	],
